WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:05.934
This [inaudible]
fellow snatched

00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:07.467
the credit you justly deserved.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:09.065
He's a rat, like the Jews.

00:00:09.066 --> 00:00:10.967
And rats must be eradicated.

00:00:10.967 --> 00:00:12.367
It's only the
very first Nobel.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:13.934
You will win the next one.

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:16.300
In this class we will deal
only with what has been proven.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.166
The existence of
molecules has not.

00:00:18.166 --> 00:00:19.467
You brought up Mr. Besso.

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:21.299
Such a charming
dinner companion.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:24.300
I do hope you return sooner
rather than later Mr. Besso.

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:27.333
[non-english speech] You
won't even know I'm gone.

00:00:27.333 --> 00:00:28.866
What a lovely thought.

00:00:28.867 --> 00:00:33.066
Dear Frau Wintere, I write
and ask you to share my feelings

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.467
with your dearest Marie.

00:00:34.467 --> 00:00:36.699
She deserves more attention
than I have to give.

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:40.400
Mother, you know very well
that I have someone else now.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.266
Mileva, you're
the love of my life.

00:00:42.266 --> 00:00:44.199
That creature, she's
just a nasty little witch.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.066
She's no witch.

00:00:45.066 --> 00:00:46.834
She's my wife.

00:00:46.834 --> 00:00:48.400
He's very busy, Papa.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.800
He can't even get a job.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.967
There is a position I
know at the patent office.

00:00:51.967 --> 00:00:53.266
I'm a scientist, Marcel.

00:00:53.266 --> 00:00:55.400
I'm better than a clerkship.

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:58.433
Welcome to the patent
office, Herr Einstein.

